    {
      "text": "Staff report: four-story, 23-unit condominium building on an 18,951 sq ft parcel in the unincorporated Sequoia Tract, R-3/S-3 zoning, High Density Residential General Plan; 3 very-low-income inclusionary units (20% of 15 base units) plus 8 density bonus units; concessions for balcony setback encroachments, 67.8% lot coverage and 4 stories/54 ft; replaces a 1970s single-family home; 385 cy grading and three significant trees removed; CEQA addendum to the MND adopted May 18, 2021; park in-lieu fee $715,362.09.",
